  "description": "After her father goes missing in a mysterious accident, Soyi Yoon is left with crippling debt and no job to escape the looming threat of loan sharks. In her desperate search for a way out, she stumbles upon a strange company full of...attractive vampires? As a manager at the Containment Facility, she’s tasked with taking down violent, uncontrollable vampires. But will she be able to keep a straight head when her charming coworkers start showing a little too much interest in her?\n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/63653603)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63653603)  \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63653616), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B8%94%EB%9F%AC%EB%93%9C-%ED%82%A4%EC%8A%A4/3999)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://tapas.io/series/blood-kiss-mature/info), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/blood_kiss), [French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/18-blood-kiss), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0DJLQNKWS/)    \nR15: [English](https://tapas.io/series/blood-kiss/info), [French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/blood-kiss), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0DJLQDBVX/) \n\n**Note**: Based on the Otome Game \"Blood Kiss\" by Storytaco.",
